{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><div class=\"container med post-content\">\n<figure class=\"img-border featured-image\">\n<img/>\n</figure>\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Apple is launching a slew of new products this month, from the AirPods 5 and Beats 360 noise-cancelling earbuds (launch-day discounts end today), the Apple Watch Series 12 and Ultra 4, to the M6 Mac mini and Mac Studio, all of which come with a lineup of new accessories.</p>\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Amazon's early-fall Prime Day sale is also extending launch deals to some products, and if you want to grab them right now, we've rounded them all up for you.</p>\n<span id=\"more-1072147\"></span>\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image alignwide size-full\"><img/></figure>\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"h-airpods-5\">AirPods 5</h2>\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>AirPods 5 (with ANC) $129</li>\n<li>AirPods 5 (with Wireless Charging Case) $149</li>\n</ul>\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image alignwide size-full\"><img/></figure>\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"h-beats-360\">Beats 360</h2>\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">***Reminder: Today is the last day to get the Beats 360 Cushion Kit at 20% off***</p>\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image alignwide size-full\"><img/></figure>\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"h-apple-watch-series-12\">Apple Watch Series 12</h2>\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"h-apple-watch-ultra-4\">Apple Watch Ultra 4</h2>\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"h-apple-watch-se-3\">Apple Watch SE 3</h2>\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image alignwide size-full\"><img/></figure>\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"h-m6-mac-mini\">M6 Mac mini</h2>\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"h-mac-studio\">Mac Studio</h2>\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"h-2026-apple-watch-bands\">2026 Apple Watch Bands</h2>\n<div class=\"wp-block-media-text\" style=\"grid-template-columns:20% auto\"><figure class=\"wp-block-media-text__media\"><img/></figure><div class=\"wp-block-media-text